# project: vertical-slice-milestone

VAR playtest_weeks = 0
VAR positive_streak = 0
VAR rework_rounds = 0

-> greybox_prototype

=== greybox_prototype ===
Greybox the core loop prototype: playable mechanics, placeholder art, nothing else.
Done when the loop can be played end to end in a weekly playtest build.
~ playtest_weeks = 0
+ [Core loop playable in greybox] -> core_loop_iteration

=== core_loop_iteration ===
Weekly playtest and iteration on the core loop.
Each week we playtest, read the room, and adjust; the creative director alone decides when it is actually fun.
~ playtest_weeks += 1
+ [Creative director calls it fun] @human -> production_art_audio
+ {playtest_weeks < 8} [Not fun yet, iterate another week] ~loop~ -> core_loop_iteration
+ {playtest_weeks >= 8} [Eight weeks in, still not fun] -> scope_change_pitch

=== scope_change_pitch ===
Pitch the publisher a scope change instead of grinding on a loop that is not landing.
Done when the publisher gives a clear yes or no on the revised scope.
+ [Publisher approves the new scope] @human ~loop~ -> greybox_prototype
+ [Publisher declines, proceed with the best current loop] @human -> production_art_audio

=== production_art_audio ===
Production art and audio for the vertical slice, replacing greybox assets.
Done when every asset in the slice is production quality.
* [Slice content complete] -> polish_pass

=== polish_pass ===
Polish pass across the slice: feel, transitions, bugs, performance.
Done when the slice is presentable to fresh internal players.
+ [Polish bar met, start the gauntlet] -> playtest_gauntlet

=== playtest_gauntlet ===
Run one internal playtest session and measure the positivity score.
The submission bar is three consecutive sessions above 80 percent positive.
+ [Session above 80 percent positive] -> gauntlet_streak
+ [Session at or below 80 percent positive] -> gauntlet_reset

=== gauntlet_streak ===
Record the positive session and check the streak.
~ positive_streak += 1
+ {positive_streak >= 3} [Three consecutive wins, submit the slice] -> submit_milestone
+ {positive_streak < 3} [Streak alive, run the next session] ~loop~ -> playtest_gauntlet

=== gauntlet_reset ===
A session missed the bar, so the streak resets to zero.
Fold the session feedback into the slice before running again.
~ positive_streak = 0
+ [Fold feedback into another polish round] ~loop~ -> polish_pass
+ [Gauntlet is not converging, leadership decides to submit as-is] @human -> submit_milestone

=== submit_milestone ===
Package and submit the vertical slice milestone to the publisher.
-> publisher_review

=== publisher_review ===
The publisher reviews the milestone against the contract.
Outcomes: pass, notes, or hard fail.
+ [Pass, funding continues] @human -> END
+ {rework_rounds < 1} [Notes, one rework round granted] @human -> rework
+ [Hard fail, cure period triggered] @human -> cure_period

=== rework ===
Address the publisher's notes on the slice.
Done when every note is resolved or explicitly answered.
~ rework_rounds += 1
+ [Resubmit the revised slice] ~loop~ -> publisher_review

=== cure_period ===
The contract's cure period: do-or-die.
Leadership decides whether to spend our own runway fixing the slice or negotiate an exit.
+ [Spend our runway to fix it] @human -> rework
+ [Negotiate an exit with the publisher] @human -> END
